4
00:00:18.109 --> 00:00:22.886
"This jacket is ugly too. No one will buy it!"

5
00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:24.537
Creak.

6
00:00:24.538 --> 00:00:26.543
The worker spun around.

7
00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:31.802
