00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:05.638
fashion." "I do," Terrell said. "I think it's important to look your best."

30
00:02:05.639 --> 00:02:09.147
"I agree," Sophie said.

31
00:02:09.148 --> 00:02:12.532
"What about you, Roxy?" Terrell asked.

32
00:02:12.533 --> 00:02:14.508
"Do you like fashion?"

33
00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:19.616
Roxy shrugged. "I don't really care about fashion either."

34
00:02:19.617 --> 00:02:26.233
Sophie glanced over. "Yes, you do. You just don't realize it.

35
00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:28.206
You might not wear fancy clothes.

36
00:02:28.207 --> 00:02:33.350
But you wear things that make you feel good."

37
00:02:33.351 --> 00:02:36.968
"I just wear whatever is in my closet," Roxy said.

38
00:02:36.969 --> 00:02:39.632
"It doesn't matter what it is."

39
00:02:39.633 --> 00:02:43.037
A model walked by wearing a cape.

40
00:02:43.038 --> 00:02:47.468
Jack laughed. "He looks like Rocket Girl!"

41
00:02:47.469 --> 00:02:49.822
Then he tapped his chin.

42
00:02:49.823 --> 00:02:52.155
"It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here.

43
00:02:52.156 --> 00:02:55.205
Maybe she could get a new costume."

44
00:02:55.206 --> 00:02:57.874
Roxy suddenly felt embarrassed.

45
00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:02.521
"What's wrong with my costume?" she thought.

46
00:03:02.522 --> 00:03:04.651
Terrell looked angry.

47
00:03:04.652 --> 00:03:07.326
"Rocket Girl doesn't need a new costume!

48
00:03:07.327 --> 00:03:09.867
The one she has is perfect!"

49
00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:14.239
Jack held up his hands. "I was just kidding!"

50
00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.489
Roxy smiled at Terrell.

51
00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:20.064
Just then her watch beeped.

52
00:03:20.065 --> 00:03:23.899
"I'll be right back," she said.

53
00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:28.675
Roxy went into a hallway.

54
00:03:28.676 --> 00:03:32.527
"Mayor Bloom. Is everything okay?"

55
00:03:32.528 --> 00:03:34.507
Mayor Bloom looked scared.

56
00:03:34.508 --> 00:03:38.272
"Rocket Girl, you must go to Trends Department Store.

57
00:03:38.273 --> 00:03:40.834
The mannequins, they . . . "

58
00:03:40.835 --> 00:03:45.406
"What?" Roxy asked. "What about the mannequins?"

59
00:03:45.407 --> 00:03:50.826
Mayor Bloom gulped. "They . . . came to life!"

60
00:03:50.827 --> 00:03:53.366
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

61
00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:57.898
"I'm on my way!"

